[{"title":"广陵访周公瑕不遇云自仪真失之 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"豪华自古让维扬，一水横江即异乡。\n二十四桥歌吹遍，不知何处觅周郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12474,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵访周公瑕不遇云自仪真失之 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"初闻相失在仪真，怨水愁风且莫论。\n道是使星还是客，教君难辨斗间人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12475,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过中山视故人赵参议时废疾者十二年矣 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"满庭黄叶满床尘，总为人疏鸟雀亲。\n与说病身应莫恨，何人不是半残人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12476,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过中山视故人赵参议时废疾者十二年矣 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"多买城南种秫田，匡床拥被日陶然。\n真成四醉中山酒，不踏人间十二年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12477,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日完县署中 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"九月九日客衣单，风似并刀月似环。\n为问羽书临雁塞，何如杯酒醉龙山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12478,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日完县署中 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"空庭吏散锁楸梧，不独黄花事事无。\n最厌耳边重九字，天涯兄弟各茱萸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12479,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"食滹沱鱼戏作","author":"王世贞","text":"滹沱鱼尾真全赤，况复车轮败后炊。\n三辅周遭二千里，从今鱼乐也应知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12480,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"娘子关偶成","author":"王世贞","text":"夫人城北走降氐，娘子军前高义旗。\n今日关头成独笑，可无巾帼赠男儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12481,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题马岭山中泉自嘲兼呈于鳞子与","author":"王世贞","text":"坼峡分流各吐奇，争先翻道出山迟。\n即令到海成何事，竟日行吟无倦时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12482,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"井陉署中偶成","author":"王世贞","text":"霜天尽日马蹄间，浊酒青灯未破颜。\n好道使君厨传薄，案头长供太行山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12483,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阜平汤泉 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"玉乳潺湲兰杜芳，温柔枉自别名乡。\n春云若傍骊山足，肯作莲花第二汤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12484,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阜平汤泉 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"大荒西吐烛龙涎，暗向中原地底穿。\n两乞君王汤沐地，酒泉尝罢浴温泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12485,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阜平汤泉 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"浴罢支颐坐自看，五台如案五云端。\n清凉蠲尽人间暑，此水仍驱万古寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12486,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赠漳浦张封君 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"闽海金波返照开，一星南极傍三台。\n君家天上张公子，曾向郎官宿里来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12487,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赠漳浦张封君 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"十二梁山青刺天，宁阳七十二飞泉。\n一泉一岁酿春酒，好致梁山张果前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12488,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赠漳浦张封君 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"蜡湖春涨读书堂，纱帽膝衫坐隐囊。\n总为新诗似何逊，山人今带水曹郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12489,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柏林寺","author":"王世贞","text":"赵州城东古柏林，赵州阇黎知我深。\n究竟现应居士法，不须瓜蔓老婆心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12490,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢万曰忠并询之 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"髡尽垂杨千万枝，又教冰雪拥皴皮。\n不知生意犹存否，惭愧东风特地吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12491,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢万曰忠并询之 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"一唱天鸡海日红，中原曙色满千峰。\n无端更遇姑苏客，依旧青山夜半钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12492,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢万曰忠并询之 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"羃历千林雨色中，浮云忽捲现长空。\n欲知为雨为云际，元是青天万里同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12493,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢万曰忠并询之 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"沧海那如性海澄，此中无减亦无增。\n祇怜拈破真乘后，依旧人间属小乘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12494,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南和道中","author":"王世贞","text":"流水湾环去马迟，淡黄斜日印沙陂。\n枫人虽老稻孙少，不到江南应不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12495,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"还宫怨 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"阿监初传唤故姬，六宫先已妒蛾眉。\n昭阳夜甃寒如水，元似增成奉帚时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12496,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"还宫怨 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"报道羊车指日临，莫题纨扇罢悲吟。\n双蛾欲画仍教洗，恐负当年辞辇心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12497,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕侍郎自制桑落酒绝佳以一瓿见饷赋此为谢并乞酿方 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"酦醅初绿豆花香，稳胜河东旧索郎。\n今夜五更残月色，不须惆怅醉为乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12498,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕侍郎自制桑落酒绝佳以一瓿见饷赋此为谢并乞酿方 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"故园桑落霜风软，紫蟹黄甘事事丰。\n乞得君家刘白堕，步兵明日下江东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12499,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别周公瑕","author":"王世贞","text":"月明乌鹊动离愁，歌到周郎莫点头。\n三竺六桥浑似画，可能无意向杭州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12500,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别尤子求沈道振","author":"王世贞","text":"风软波平天地宽，玉壶银酎水晶盘。\n离筵好景俱堪写，祇是归鸿目送难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12501,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别瞻美弟","author":"王世贞","text":"醉里轻舠别惠连，醒时孤雁泣江烟。\n不须论到池塘句，酒态如兄便可怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12502,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别曹甥子念","author":"王世贞","text":"虱须不分作山人，却买林宗折角巾。\n莫倚新诗能似舅，几人如舅未全贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12503,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别王复","author":"王世贞","text":"吴船捩柁越船催，少选须倾三百杯。\n除却芙蓉池上酒，几家能见玉山颓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12504,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别李时养","author":"王世贞","text":"劳君相送霅溪头，霅里风光事事幽。\n欲共一枰消永日，教人重唤李杭州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12505,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别张三","author":"王世贞","text":"千觞不醉洗天亭，一曲汪伦最有情。\n不分游人明夜月，依稀拾得绕梁声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12506,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又别诸君","author":"王世贞","text":"尊前北斗渐阑干，领取清歌半刻欢。\n列棹回波真自乐，一官行路未为难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12507,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠虎跑泉庵良缙上人","author":"王世贞","text":"虎跑閒居二十年，可曾双虎到兹泉。\n山神纵有皈依念，其那山僧入四禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12508,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见逐参方僧禁约戏成一绝","author":"王世贞","text":"约束飞来峰去后，便驱天竺旧胡神。\n阎浮未有三生籍，若个人非行脚人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12509,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岘山有朋寿堂盖为大司空蒋公刘公大司寇顾公筑也已已岁余与吴比部范太史嗣游焉吴与余俱丙戌范丁亥因题一绝以为四十年左證云","author":"王世贞","text":"霜色蒹葭鬓共新，倚来双玉暂精神。\n还因四十馀年后，朋寿堂中第二人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12510,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"应黄州惠苏长公墨迹却以一诗附还","author":"王世贞","text":"砑光藤纸墨华流，欲报璚瑶未敢收。\n总为临池贪玉局，可应遗翰去黄州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12511,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东行访张伯起不遇饮幼于别馆 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"柴门不启白云栖，为忆君名未敢题。\n何似竹林嵇叔夜，携琴载酒夕阳低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12512,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东行访张伯起不遇饮幼于别馆 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"浮云舒卷元无意，鹤怨猿惊未必真。\n赢得嗣宗心一片，不将青眼傍他人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12513,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华婿水部以事质余湖上小语竟别 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"白舫青门杨柳丝，湖中公事出偏迟。\n婆娑手板桓公府，应笑蓝田晚更痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12514,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华婿水部以事质余湖上小语竟别 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"萧萧寒雨湿归航，片语离尊味更长。\n此别应须不惆怅，卫郎无病到膏肓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12515,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酌六一泉为故茅学士书院","author":"王世贞","text":"六一居士迹不到，千古人呼六一泉。\n争信碧山茅学士，十年中夜枕泉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12516,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日官舍无事携元白长庆集阅一遍题此二绝句后置之箧中矣 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"十口官贫不遣随，偶携元白两编诗。\n花犀欲角蚕将茧，莫病通天累色丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12517,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日官舍无事携元白长庆集阅一遍题此二绝句后置之箧中矣 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"连翩逐客上皇都，三月中书片语无。\n不是通江少时谪，千年佳句一生孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12518,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈生授经术吴中","author":"王世贞","text":"知君经术自河汾，坐里谈锋欲吐云。\n到处虎皮应自彻，不须羔雁诧成群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12519,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"严州有感","author":"王世贞","text":"虚劳物色到羊裘，咄咄老翁何所求。\n一夜天能动星象，千秋人不改严州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12520,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"一株红瘦隔天涯，珠箔深沈贴绛纱。\n欲赏清尊风雨隔，负他三月尽时花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12521,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"江南秋尽雁初飞，应是深闺欲寄衣。\n剔罢银灯金剪涩，一双红箸隐寒机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12522,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塘栖道中得转山西报自嘲 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"长河风雪舞孤舟，兴尽真成王子猷。\n尘世偶然那可料，故乡明日是并州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12523,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塘栖道中得转山西报自嘲 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"薄禄风尘业未偿，除书一纸下钱塘。\n休言宦兴生平薄，已自将心度太行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12524,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用晦寄四种杯仍系以诗走笔二绝为谢 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"刘生自昔誇三雅，何似君家四种杯。\n罚处已赢金谷数，飞时不怕玉山颓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12525,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用晦寄四种杯仍系以诗走笔二绝为谢 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"饶瓷宣盌白于霜，鹦鹉螺兼翡翠觞。\n我欲按来成一钵，大罗天上贮三浆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12526,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠曹子念偕舍弟游燕三绝句 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"江南二月杨柳阴，蓟门雪花三尺深。\n祇为和歌燕市好，不知台上有黄金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12527,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠曹子念偕舍弟游燕三绝句 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"河东股肱吾倦游，上书谒告行且休。\n世上浮荣沾即厌，不将名姓托曹丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12528,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠曹子念偕舍弟游燕三绝句 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"吾家才子谢惠连，兼程携汝蓟门天。\n蓟门五侯不解识，何如乞取长瑜还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12529,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慎侍御子正借书","author":"王世贞","text":"苕水穿阶草满除，萧然都似子云居。\n十年铅椠头堪白，又乞那家未校书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12530,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中丞徐公追挽先君三章甫至举寒食奠感叹之馀因成二绝奉报 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"杨柳摇青寒食新，十年天地一伤春。\n那知郢里归魂句，元是南州絮酒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12531,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中丞徐公追挽先君三章甫至举寒食奠感叹之馀因成二绝奉报 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"昼晴初解白杨哀，忽地萧骚暮响催。\n不是陇头春不到，西江风送薤歌来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12532,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊午岁叔达甥兄弟弱冠应试余寄诗勉之曰玉树元双挺鹓雏好并翻外家饶宅相若个魏阳元又一纪而叔达文日益高有名然宅相犹未应也今年春来别余应南京试复为一绝以促之","author":"王世贞","text":"休将宅相问乌衣，似舅如甥已自稀。\n却月观头金粟树，可能先折一枝归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12533,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"予方有乞休之请而日者凌生索诗遂成二绝 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"一官憔悴足藏名，浊酒青山供此生。\n到了自来还自去，钟家错畏管公明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12534,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"予方有乞休之请而日者凌生索诗遂成二绝 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"春朝中酒未曾醒，论吉论凶总不应。\n还却豸冠神武去，负他头上贵人星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12535,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得宋拓右军帖上卷绝佳而大令帖不至戏成一绝","author":"王世贞","text":"箕裘谁复二王如，底事吴兴一卷虚。\n记得向来贞观例，黄金遍购右军书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12536,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵承旨为恭阇黎写经毕以诗乞茶真迹在余所戏代恭荅","author":"王世贞","text":"玉堂润笔元无价，珍重吴兴祇换茶。\n但使毫端吐舍利，一蒙山顶属君家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12537,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宋拓兰亭记后","author":"王世贞","text":"昭陵玉匣去人间，定武皇孙未易攀。\n留得云仍隆准在，不教惆怅忆龙颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12538,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题韩熙载夜宴图 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"遏云歌罢舞回风，夜半腰支不属公。\n屈戍乍摇纱影弄，可应人是顾宏中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12539,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题韩熙载夜宴图 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"由来歌舞破江山，庭树能催王气残。\n唱得浣溪宫样句，小楼吹彻玉笙寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12540,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题韩熙载夜宴图 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"烧来红泪尽辞银，花拥舒郎别院春。\n国虽家雠都未了，可能还较绝缨人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12541,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴六首 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"白家柳枝不忍折，韩家柳枝却复春。\n争似金明池上絮，随风吹去作沙尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12542,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴六首 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"桃花片片委潇湘，棹入桃源转断肠。\n懊恨羲和排历后，不教风雨属东皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12543,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴六首 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"胡床挂壁未曾收，欲烬垆香袅尚浮。\n行到东廊才一步，猛惊残日上帘钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12544,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴六首 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"峭风俄扫蒻房空，恍忽还疑在梦中。\n毕竟怨亲何所似，偶然萍水复西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12545,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴六首 其五","author":"王世贞","text":"欲酌仍停鹦鹉螺，酒醒长叹对银河。\n傍人总会应难语，但道中年感慨多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12546,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴六首 其六","author":"王世贞","text":"单车柳色太行新，浊酒寒灯供此身。\n燕赵向来多似玉，懒教人唤负心人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12547,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁阳驿小饮戏作","author":"王世贞","text":"两三杯酒也成醉，四十五年真是翁。\n独对琅琊数峰坐，可将前号让欧公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12548,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过清流关","author":"王世贞","text":"层崖一道写潺湲，知是清流旧日关。\n独树遥天挂霞色，尚疑飞将挟俘还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12549,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]